Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 Digimon Lab fills 16:9

The Digimon Lab (STGDGLAB: the Select Action menu, the party, the digivolve
screens) ran with gutter 0. port/options/widescreen.c gives the overlay the
menu gutter and:

- the scrolling background (96 px period) is drawn twice more, 96 pixels to
  each side, as patch 0053;
- the status and stats panels of the menu, the party and the slot screens
  that hang from the left edge are drawn one gutter further left
  (DW3_MENU_LEFT) with their windows, the partner sprite and their pivots;
- the plates that run off the right edge are extended to the picture's edge
  (DW3_MENU_EXTEND) and the full-width bands are widened (DW3_MENU_BAND);
  their open pivots follow the 16:9 right edge.

The chart, entry and skill screens keep their left-hung panels at the 4:3
edge (only their right plates and bands are widened). Only drawing positions
change. Off (gutter 0) every position is the PS1 one.

